E030_assign_to_string_element.cmm:4:5: semantic error: strings are immutable; cannot assign to an element
  |
4 |     s[0] = "H";
  |     ^
what went wrong:
  Text cannot be changed letter by letter in C--.
how to fix:
  Build the result another way, for example with a list<string> or by
  creating a new string.
